      "description": "Videwatch is a dedicated Apple Watch media player.\n\n● Play videos & audio at high quality\n● Play offline at any time\n● Use the Apple Watch speaker or headphones\n● Play all & shuffle options\n● Resume playback from last position\n● Organize with folders\n● Now Playing app support\n● Add podcasts & audiobooks\n● Play directly from your watch faces\n● Sort by recently played, name, duration, or when added\n● Choose from four different display options\n● Fast forward or rewind videos, by tapping the player progress bar\n\nAdd media:\n● From iPhone, iCloud, Google Drive, Dropbox, & more sources\n● Using a url (YouTube not currently supported)\n● From other apps, such as Photos and Mail\n\nVideo supported:\n● MP4, MOV, M4V\n\nFor audio we recommend our dedicated audio app WatchAudio.\n\nAudio files supported:\n● MP3, M4A, AAC, WAV, AIF, AIFF, AU, CAF, FLAC\n● M4B (audiobooks non-protected)",
